{
  "id": "douyin-article",
  "platform": "douyin",
  "mode": "article",
  "name": "抖音 · 长文",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "name": "标题生成",
      "type": "title",
      "needs": [],
      "promptTemplate": "douyin/article/title.md",
      "humanGate": true,
      "defaultProvider": "cli-claude"
    },
    {
      "id": "content",
      "name": "长文生成",
      "type": "content",
      "needs": [
        "title"
      ],
      "promptTemplate": "douyin/article/content.md",
      "defaultProvider": "cli-claude"
    },
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "name": "封面生成",
      "type": "cover",
      "needs": [
        "title"
      ],
      "promptTemplate": "douyin/article/cover.md",
      "defaultProvider": "api-jimeng",
      "coverSizes": [
        {
          "w": 1080,
          "h": 1440,
          "label": "抖音长文 3:4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "name": "评审评分",
      "type": "review",
      "needs": [
        "title",
        "content"
      ],
      "promptTemplate": "common/review.md",
      "defaultProvider": "api-deepseek"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "长文建议 800-2000 字，分段清晰、每段不超过 5 行",
    "首段 50 字内给出核心观点，避免长铺垫",
    "封面 3:4 竖版，标题文字清晰可读",
    "避免极限词与诱导关注话术",
    "发布前通读一遍，检查错别字与段落排版"
  ]
}
